  {%- capture support_url -%}{%- render 'somna-policy-url', handle: 'support' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- render 'somna-policy-glance', items: '[100] nights to try any sleep product at home|Free returns in the [US], no restocking fees|Refunds to your original payment within [5–7] business days|Free exchanges for a different size or firmness' -%}

  <h2 id="trial">1. The [100]-Night Trial</h2>
  <p>Every {AppName} pillow and comforter comes with a [100]-night home trial, starting the day your order is delivered. We ask that you sleep on it for at least [14] nights first, because your body needs time to adjust to new support.</p>
  <p>The trial applies to orders placed directly on [yourdomain].com. Products bought from other retailers follow that retailer's return policy.</p>

  <h2 id="start">2. How to Start a Return</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Visit our <a href="{{ support_url }}">Help Center</a> or email [returns@yourdomain.com] with your order number.</li>
    <li>Tell us what isn't working. We may suggest an exchange that fixes it.</li>
    <li>We'll email a prepaid return label, or arrange a donation pickup for bulky items.</li>
    <li>Pack the item in any box. The original packaging isn't required.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Limit of [one] trial return per product type per household.</p>

  <h2 id="refunds">3. Refunds</h2>
  <p>Once your return is received and checked, we'll refund the product price to your original payment method within [5–7] business days. Original shipping charges are [refundable / non-refundable]. Free gifts received with the order don't need to be returned, [or: will be deducted at full value if kept].</p>
  <p>If you paid with Shop Pay Installments or Afterpay, the refund goes back to that provider and they adjust your plan.</p>

  <h2 id="exchanges">4. Exchanges</h2>
  <p>Want a different size, firmness or warmth? Exchanges are free during your trial. We'll ship the replacement as soon as the return label is scanned.</p>

  <h2 id="exceptions">5. Items That Can't Be Returned</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Gift cards</li>
    <li>Final-sale and clearance items, marked as such at checkout</li>
    <li>[Opened Silk Sleep Masks and pillowcases, for hygiene reasons]</li>
    <li>Items damaged by misuse, stains or not following the care label</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="damaged">6. Damaged, Defective or Wrong Items</h2>
  <p>If something arrives damaged or isn't what you ordered, contact us within [14] days of delivery with your order number and a photo. We'll send a replacement or refund at no cost, and you won't need to send the original back.</p>

  <h2 id="warranty">7. Warranty</h2>
  <p>Outside the trial, manufacturing defects are covered by our [lifetime / X-year] limited warranty. It covers issues like seam failure or fill loss under normal use, not normal wear or accidental damage. Read the full warranty terms on our [Warranty page].</p>

  <h2 id="contact">8. Contact Us</h2>
  {%- render 'somna-policy-cta', title: 'Questions about a return?', text: 'Email [returns@yourdomain.com] with your order number. We reply within [24 hours].', label: 'Start a Return', url: support_url -%}
{%- endif -%}
